goloco is a reimplementation of Chris Sawyer's Locomotion that ports much of
its behaviour from OpenLoco (https://github.com/OpenLoco/OpenLoco), and it
ships OpenLoco's language packs verbatim in data/language/ (built into the
binary through embed.go). That work is OpenLoco's, under the following
